{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-14-1","title":"Psalms 14:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David describes a natural man. 4 He convinces the wicked by the light of their conscience. 7 He glories in the salvation of God.</p>\n<p>fool. 73:3; 92:6; 107:17; 1Sa 25:25; Pr 1:7,22; 13:19; 27:22; Lu 12:20 no. 10:4; *marg: 52:1-6; Job 22:13; Ro 1:28; Eph 2:12 They are. 36:1-4; 94:4-8; Ge 6:5,11,12; Isa 1:4 abominable. Job 15:16; Mt 12:34; 15:19; Joh 3:19,20; Ro 1:21-32; Tit 1:16; 3:3 Re 21:8 there. Ro 3:10-12; Eph 2:1-3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-14-2","title":"Psalms 14:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>The Lord. 33:13,14; 102:19,20; Ge 6:12; 11:5; 18:21; Isa 63:15; 64:1; La 3:50 any. 82:5; 107:43; Pr 2:9; 8:5; 9:4,16; Isa 27:11; Jer 4:22; Da 12:10 Mt 13:15; Ro 3:11 seek. 69:32; 2Ch 19:3; 30:19; Isa 8:19; 55:6; Heb 11:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-14-3","title":"Psalms 14:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>all gone. 119:176; Ec 7:29; Isa 53:6; 59:7,8,13-15; Jer 2:13; Ro 3:10-12,23 Eph 2:3; 2Pe 2:13-15 filthy. Heb. stinking. 38:5; Job 15:16; Isa 64:6; Eze 36:25; 2Co 7:1 there. 1; Ex 8:31; 12:30; De 1:35; Job 14:4; Ro 3:10; 1Co 6:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-14-4","title":"Psalms 14:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Have. 94:8,9; Isa 5:13; 27:11; 29:14; 44:19,20; 45:20; Ro 1:21,22,28 2Co 4:3,4; Eph 4:17,18 eat up. Jer 10:25; Am 8:4; Mic 3:2,3; Ga 5:15 and. 79:6; Job 21:15; 27:10; Isa 64:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-14-5","title":"Psalms 14:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>were, etc. Heb. they feared a fear. 53:5; Ex 15:16; Es 8:7; Pr 1:26,27; 28:1 God. 46:5,7,11; Isa 8:10; 12:6; 41:10; 43:1,2; Mt 1:23 the generation. 22:30; 24:6; 73:15; 112:2; 1Pe 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-14-6","title":"Psalms 14:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Ye. 3:2; 4:2; 22:7,8; 42:10; Ne 4:2-4; Isa 37:10,11; Eze 35:10; Da 3:15 Mt 27:40-43 Lord. 9:9; Heb 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-14-7","title":"Psalms 14:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":14,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":14,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Oh, etc. Heb. Who will give, etc. 53:6</p>"}]}